{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/914738-what-s-your-favorite-music-for-mage-the-awakening","id":914738,"title":"What's your favorite Music for Mage the Awakening","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-15T04:16:01-07:00","id":914738,"title":"What's your favorite Music for Mage the Awakening","content":"So I was trying to get a game worked out and I thought &quot;why not check Youtube for a playlist?&quot; and what I found was disappointing. So There are two official playlist for Mage, one is the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLiNRTdSDh6-Vz8FIHF0gDz4JqLH0WjLsJ\" target=\"_blank\">Mood music</a> which isn't that bad ; and then there's Daveb's <a href=\"https://youtu.be/cUchAD44xA8?list=PLxNpDUlclGojuynFQkQ5CQf-P27lmncgv\" target=\"_blank\">Supernal mix</a>, which I thought was awesome. So it got me thinking, what's in a playlist. Does it say something objectively about the perspective of the storyteller? So I spent the next hour throwing something together so that I could share where my mind goes when I create a story for MtAw. I'd love to hear what mind set other storytellers so please, comment with anything from a link, a playlist, or just a favorite song.<br /> <br /> This is My Playlist<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfjOo-ANUVJpSqVaALia1QvY5aYmVdZaZ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfjOo-ANUVJpSqVaALia1QvY5aYmVdZaZ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfjOo-ANUVJpSqVaALia1QvY5aYmVdZaZ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfjOo-ANUVJpSqVaALia1QvY5aYmVdZaZ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6516-mefathiel8","name":"mefathiel8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T05:20:10-07:00","id":914763,"title":"","content":"I have some youtube playlists for mage, though they haven't been updated for quite some time, because I focused more on Legend of Five Rings due to &quot;2nd-ed-was-almost-here!&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rsRqyaHLeRY&amp;list=PLYkcBePQfuI89SKTvuME1h-42971MV67o\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rsRq...E1h-42971MV67o</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=asI8hvS6Ho4&amp;list=PLYkcBePQfuI8T0mD8Wc4tVS0PhZK7E7CV&amp;index=2&amp;shuffle=161\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=asI8...=2&amp;shuffle=161</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BDHXZ4Fjqr8&amp;list=PLYkcBePQfuI91CBy53vUPCly7agV21J1t\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BDHX...UPCly7agV21J1t</a><br /> <br /> As a general rule, I don't use songs with lyrics as BGM.<br /> ...I wonder what my playlists tell about me, my perspective, and other stuff.<br /> <br /> EDIT<br /> If someone would ask me to pick a one music track that would become a main theme of Chronicle, deciding it's tone and colour, I would pick this in a heartbeat <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6oUQQ59WM3k\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6oUQQ59WM3k</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","user":"WHW","date":". 06-15-2016, 08:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T06:16:50-07:00","id":914777,"title":"","content":"Progressive rock doesn't fit it quite as well as it fits Ascension, but that's only because it fits Ascension so perfectly. It's still excellent mood music. <br /> <br /> I actually made an Awakening/Ascension playlist- <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/user/geckopirateship/playlist/7DNlhmOh5DfeeFwAPIkvBH\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.spotify.com/user/geckop...5DfeeFwAPIkvBH</a> and quite a few of the songs fit Awakening specifically. <br /> <br /> And of course the Homestuck soundtrack has every kind of BGM for any setting you could think of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T07:21:09-07:00","id":914814,"title":"","content":"OK, I made a thing. Or 3 things. Or 4 things. These are basically playlists for my current Mage Character, Acanthus Apostate Detective Sherridan Sherrinford, with unhealthy dose of Death as a side study<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLYkcBePQfuI9JtRVlGx8rviSPSEpu7Q9K\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?lis...8rviSPSEpu7Q9K</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLYkcBePQfuI916ixEfXYIExW-k0WlPoe-\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?lis...YIExW-k0WlPoe-</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLYkcBePQfuI-7V1WNPZ2jWPC-S6vzOKiK\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?lis...2jWPC-S6vzOKiK</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLYkcBePQfuI-TrnU_LqAlaY5a_vfdy8WS\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?lis...AlaY5a_vfdy8WS</a><br /> <br /> While I don't expect even half of these tracks to be fully used, I had a lot of fun finding them and fitting them into character, trying to create 4 different playlists with 4 different moods that feel coherent. If someone is bored, they can try to guess character and personality traits of my PC. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","user":"WHW","date":". 06-15-2016, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T15:17:04-07:00","id":915870,"title":"","content":"The last character I played in Awakening was a Silver Ladder Thyrsus who ran a strip club on the sunset blvd, Lictor to the stars. The whole character was based around defining the difference between debauchery and celebrating in the Lex Magica of the Consilieum. Came up with everything while Listening to old 60's rock. Spirit in the Sky, The Wind Cries Mary, Ever Seen the Rain. Good Stuff for Spirit. And WHW ... CHALLANGE ACCEPTED. I am that bored.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6516-mefathiel8","name":"mefathiel8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T15:47:02-07:00","id":915889,"title":"","content":"Founding music with lyrics to be too disconcerting on game session - I'm much more OST / instrumental music man, that use specific tracks for particular scenes I need distinguished from other. For example, I plan to (almost) start my next London game from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v43sM2mcFZE\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminati track</a> with Seers ambush on PCs. And then put hard 'British rock lesson' for players in London Temenos Realm. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T07:17:23-07:00","id":916173,"title":"","content":"As the OP posted, there are two types of music. a)The one you play through the session for mood and b) the one you take inspiration form. Also, it depends on the setting and the feeling you want to evoce on your Chronicle. Also, different people regard each song differently. One might relate to a song due to its music, its title, part of lyrics or an emotion/memory he tied the song too. Anyway, here is my list.<br /> <br /> Chronicle Themes: Dark Gothic, Fantasy, Lovercraftian, <br /> <br /> a) Mood Music - Chronicle Soundtrack<br /> Arsonist's Lullabye - Hozier: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yEtkIRlz7Vw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yEtkIRlz7Vw</a><br /> Setting theme<br /> <br /> The Trail - The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s3L0_ez0Dg4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s3L0_ez0Dg4</a><br /> Dark Souls III theme: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stWae6r7Blw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stWae6r7Blw</a><br /> Dark Mystery-Epic Music<br /> <br /> Bad Habit - The Kooks: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3tUh-x-fp8Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3tUh-x-fp8Q</a><br /> &quot;...You know I wish I had it all...&quot; Obsession<br /> <br /> Blood Red Roses - C21 FX: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hosCuzo6JKo\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hosCuzo6JKo</a><br /> Sad/horror Scenes<br /> <br /> Make it Rain - Ed Sheeran: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzLCQaHF84o\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzLCQaHF84o</a><br /> Sad Scenes<br /> <br /> Mermaid Song - Sarah Khider: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYPsFVkLE2k\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYPsFVkLE2k</a><br /> Soap Opera/Romance Scenes<br /> <br /> b) Inspirational Tacks<br /> Angel of Small Death &amp; the Codeine Scene - Hozier: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-bmp4QWzHak\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-bmp4QWzHak</a><br /> &quot;...Calling to join them the wreched and joyfull shaking the wings of their terrible youth...&quot;<br /> &quot;...freshly disowned in some frosen devotion...&quot;<br /> <br /> Renegades - X Ambassadors: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8j741TUIET0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8j741TUIET0</a><br /> Free Counsil theme song<br /> <br /> Lonely Road - Silked &amp; Stained: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qp9Bh6EgkeY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qp9Bh6EgkeY</a><br /> &quot;...This' my road, the role I wanna play for me...&quot;<br /> <br /> Now I would like to share a greek song that I found recently. The Awakened theme sealed in these lyrics was mindblowing for me (we are aparently very conservative/relegious society. People just don't write about occult stuff without weird reactions from half the population)<br /> <br /> O magos (The magician)- Hainides (Greek song): <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05dmi3ycftc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05dmi3ycftc</a><br /> <br /> For those that want to check it out here lies the translation:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">A mage in our village came<br /> once upon a time </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">(he) from the waist up human was<br /> (he had) from below goat hide.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Then the villagers arrived,<br /> (they) gathered all around,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and they named his goaty lot</span></span><br /> a blessing from the ground<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">&quot;Tell us, oh mage, if you can,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">if rains soon will ever come.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Bless your harvest, if you do,<br /> to painlessly your seeds come due.&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">With a powerful magical glance</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and his mystical tragic dance</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">they heard something so pure and true</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">that ripped their inner souls in two.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">&quot;Mage with the goaty lot,<br /> you corrupt our feature.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Hurry, people, hide the kids<br /> they shouldn't see the creature.&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Like a wolf pack they attacked<br /> The sacreligeous mage (was) now bound.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">in a cell that they had build<br /> from fire, ice and ground.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And a weird little freakish kid</span></span><br /> secretly turned his home's key<br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">To break away was his cause</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">The mage it wanted (to) see, of course.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And it told with a freakish gaze</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">full of ice and ablaze (that)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">The goaty mage was like the rest (the villagers)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and that the world is not at rest.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">The little kid that lost his mind<br /> due to the mages lies</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">In unknown reaches they exiled<br /> beyond the seven skies.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Beyond the seven seas and lands<br /> for years I've traveled</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">the poor kid that it was lost<br /> to bring back unhasseled</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Through torrment, rain, burning heat</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I battle with my every beat</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And from my heart's each and every hack</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Roboto, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">the souls are feed, they give no slack</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">For they will teach me what I seek;</span></span><br /> The very truth's own mystique;<br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">That love is the Supernal strath</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and that kid is my Supernal path</span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","name":"Shadowjim12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T08:43:06-07:00","id":916239,"title":"","content":"<u>Into the Labyrinth</u>, by <b>Dead Can Dance</b>. Excellent mage album when Ascension first came out, hasn't changed with Awakening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6770-midgardener","name":"Midgardener","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6770_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T08:45:40-07:00","id":916242,"title":"","content":"As some people already said there are two types of music; a) Mood that works like a soundtrack and b) Music that you draw inspiration from (like it's lyrics, title, emotions etc)<br /> So here is my list:<br /> a) Mood/Soundtrack<br /> <br /> <b>Chronicle's Main Theme:</b><br /> Bad Habit - The Kooks: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3tUh-x-fp8Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3tUh-x-fp8Q</a><br /> Arsonist's Lullaby - Hozier: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yEtkIRlz7Vw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yEtkIRlz7Vw</a> (&quot;..Don't you ever tame your Demons..&quot;)<br /> Angel of Small Death &amp; the Codeine Scene - Hozier: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-bmp4QWzHak\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-bmp4QWzHak</a><br /> Renegades - X Ambassadors: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8j741TUIET0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8j741TUIET0</a> (Free Counsil theme song :P )<br /> <br /> <b>Sad Scenes:</b><br /> Make it Rain - Ed Sheeran: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzLCQaHF84o\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzLCQaHF84o</a><br /> Mermaid Song - Sarah Khider: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYPsFVkLE2k\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYPsFVkLE2k</a><br /> <br /> <b>Dark Mystery Scenes:</b><br /> X-Ray Dog/Two Steps from Hell/Trailer Music (too many to list here)<br /> Blood Red Roses - C21 FX: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hosCuzo6JKo\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hosCuzo6JKo</a><br /> Sovngarde Song - TESV: Skyrim: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VBPwCmU0V-Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VBPwCmU0V-Q</a><br /> Carnival of Rust - Poets of the Fall: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MKk1u5RMTn4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MKk1u5RMTn4</a> (Poets of the Fall... Seriously?!? :P )<br /> <br /> <b>For Epic Scenes:</b><br /> X-Ray Dog/Two Steps from Hell/Trailer Music (too many to list here)<br /> Main theme - Dark Souls III: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stWae6r7Blw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stWae6r7Blw</a><br /> The Trail - Witcher 3: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s3L0_ez0Dg4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s3L0_ez0Dg4</a><br /> <br /> b) Inspirational<br /> Demons - Imagine Dragon