r /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Then the villagers arrived<br /> They gathered all around</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and they named his goaty looks<br /> a heaven's gift earthbound</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">&quot;Tell us, oh mage, if you can,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">when will the storms if ever come.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Blessed your harvest may it be</span></span><br /> and painlessly your seeds crop free.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Then with his gaze full of might</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and with a mystic dance by night,</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">they heared a thing so pure and true</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">that split their inner souls in two.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">&quot;Warlock, with the goaty feet<br /> hide your fillthy presence deep.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">People, hurry, hide the kids<br /> lock them not to see the beast&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Like a wolf's pack they all attacked<br /> and shove the creature in a sack.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Then they draged him in a cell<br /> that they build with ice and fell.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">But a weird, little, freakish kid</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">unlocked his home with a key</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">To break away was its cause</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">the captured mage to see, of course</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And then it said with freakish eyes</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">full of terror, fire, ice.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">That the mage was like the rest (of the villagers)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and that the world changes, does not rest,</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">So that kid that (was) forced to change</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">they banished, 'cause they found it strange.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And through the seven seas I sail<br /> the same lost kid I try to trail.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Through burning heat and deadly storms</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I fight with fear in all its forms</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And from my heart's each, every hack<br /> all souls I've seen have taken slack</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">So that they will finaly commune</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">a secret deep that none's immune</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">That love is magic's endless strath</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">and that kid my Supernal Path</span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","name":"Shadowjim12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T10:51:56-07:00","id":916323,"title":"","content":"Well, appart from music here is a list of series and scenes that inspire my games:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9SuW7c28SAM\" target=\"_blank\">All Around the Consilium (from the series &quot;The Magicians&quot;)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9knLKBldoFg\" target=\"_blank\">The Exiles from the World of Magic (from the series &quot;The Witches of East End&quot;)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TpDO8JR-s58\" target=\"_blank\">A Cabal's Burden (from the series &quot;The Secret Circle&quot;)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iE1nsOoTJos\" target=\"_blank\">A Mage's Obsession (from the series &quot;Jonathan Strange &amp; Mr Norrell&quot;)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTYYsXyNqQE\" target=\"_blank\">Supernatural Relationships (from the series &quot;The Originals&quot;)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zMy5BNoUMhM\" target=\"_blank\">Apprenticeship (from the series &quot;American Horror Story: Coven&quot;)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehjJ614QfeM\" target=\"_blank\">Monster Hunt (&quot;A Night to Remember&quot; from Witcher 3: Wild Hunt)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xly6-YButlk\" target=\"_blank\">Trailing someone with Magic (&quot;The Trail&quot; from Witcher 3: Wild Hunt)</a><br /> <br /> Now, more to the point, here are some Chronicle's Songs &amp; Inspirations:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3tUh-x-fp8Q\" target=\"_blank\">The Usual Mood of First-Timer PCs on MtAw (Bad Habit - The Kooks)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8j741TUIET0\" target=\"_blank\">The Free Counsil Theme Song (Renegades - X Ambassadors)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqI78S14Wgg\" target=\"_blank\">I Hide Stuff for Your Own Good (Demons - Imagine Dragons)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yEtkIRlz7Vw\" target=\"_blank\">Don't You Ever Tame Your Demons (Arsonist's Lullaby - Hozier)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hosCuzo6JKo\" target=\"_blank\">Lullaby from the Time Before (Blood Red Roses - C21 FX)</a><br /> <br /> Finally, this is something I wanted to share with you. Its a greek song that I fall upon by accident. Here is a loose translation in English. Is it just me or does it describe perfectly an average mage chronicle?<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQHdR9thguo\" target=\"_blank\">O Magos (the Magician) - Hainides (Greek Song)</a><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> In our village a wizard came<br /> once uppon a time,<br /> From his waist up human was<br /> legs covered with goat hide<br /> <br /> Then the villagers arrived<br /> gathered all arround<br /> and they named his goaty lot<br /> a heaven's gift earthbound.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell us, oh wizard, if you may<br /> when will the skies turn to gray?<br /> Blessed your harvest may it be,<br /> please answer, we accept your fee.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then with his spellbound frightfull sight<br /> and with a horrid dance by night,<br /> they heard words so pure and true<br /> that tore their very souls in two.<br /> <br /> &quot;Foul warlock, you are blasphemous<br /> you corrupt our own feature.<br /> People, hurry, hide the kids,<br /> hide them from the creature!&quot;<br /> <br /> Like a wolf's pack they attacked<br /> and shove the mage in a shack<br /> to bind him on a cell they made<br /> with fire, ice, earth and pain<br /> <br /> But a weird strange little kid<br /> secretly turned a key it hid.<br /> To leave his house was its cause<br /> the mage it wanted see ofcourse.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:gotham\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">And then it said with freakish eyes</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">full of terror, fire, ice.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">That the mage was like the rest (of the villagers)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">and that the world changes, does not rest,</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">So that kid that (was) forced to change</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">they banished, 'cause they found it strange.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">And through the seven seas I sail<br /> the same lost kid I try to trail.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Through burning heat and deadly storms</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I fight with fear in all its forms</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">And from my heart's each, every hack<br /> all souls I've seen have taken slack</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">So that they will finaly commune</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">a secret deep that none's immune</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">That love is magic's endless strath</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">and that kid my Supernal Path</span></span></span></span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Edit: Sorry for the multiple posts.... My PC just sucks at the moment. Moderators, may you clean the Paradox I just caused? Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6169,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","user":"Shadowjim12","date":". 06-20-2016, 06:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","name":"Shadowjim12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T11:24:13-07:00","id":916337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/914738-what-s-your-favorite-music-for-mage-the-awakening?p=914814#post914814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While I don't expect even half of these tracks to be fully used, I had a lot of fun finding them and fitting them into character, trying to create 4 different playlists with 4 different moods that feel coherent. If someone is bored, they can try to guess character and personality traits of my PC. :P</div> </div> </div> </div>I do the same thing even though I know no one will hear those playlists. This my playlist for my 2E Character: <a href=\"https://play.spotify.com/user/phyi/playlist/2oxYYB063wFKiozcZQyOV1\" target=\"_blank\">https://play.spotify.com/user/phyi/p...3wFKiozcZQyOV1</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2152-phyi","nam