spect of the mage theme to me. Although sometimes this is more because of the music video or something it's been used in rather than the song itself. The song Secrets is mostly on here because it was used in sorcerer's apprentice for example.<br /> <br /> Mozart: Dies Irae<br /> Blue Oyster Cult: Don't Fear the Reaper.<br /> OneRepublic: Counting Stars. <br /> Frozen Soundtrack: Let it go.<br /> Joey Scarbury: Believe it or not (Theme to Greatest American Hero).<br /> Barry McGuire: Eve of destruction.<br /> Ke$ha: Die Young.<br /> Matchbox Twenty: Let's see how far we've come.<br /> OneRepublic: Secrets <br /> Three Days Grace: Animal I have become.<br /> Bad Religion: Come Join Us.<br /> Queen: Princes of the Universe.<br /> <br /> I don't usually use music during the session because it's too much of a distraction for me, if not the players. However I'll often listen to music while I'm preparing for the game.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T09:19:15-07:00","id":950078,"title":"","content":"Inspiration? Loads of stuff. Like literally everything done as <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyJhOCoMalsFK8vnNnPGuiA/playlists\" target=\"_blank\">World's End Girlfriend</a>.<br /> <br /> While playing? Music is verbotten. Utterly verbotten. It's so <i>damn</i> distracting (even instrumental tracks). Pro tip: ask your players before playing music as part of a game. There are some people (like me) who find it distracting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't re